<section class="section bg-sage" aria-labelledby="how-it-works-title">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Simple planning, personal support</p>
      <h2 id="how-it-works-title">How It Works</h2>
      <p>From choosing a destination to confirming the final itinerary, the planning process stays clear and straightforward.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      <article class="process-card">
        <span class="process-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
        <div class="process-icon" aria-hidden="true">🧭</div>
        <h3>Choose Your Journey</h3>
        <p>Browse destinations and packages across Darjeeling, Sikkim, Assam and beyond.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="process-card">
        <span class="process-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
        <div class="process-icon" aria-hidden="true">✏️</div>
        <h3>Share Your Preferences</h3>
        <p>Tell us your travel dates, group size, interests, hotel preference and approximate budget.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="process-card">
        <span class="process-number" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
        <div class="process-icon" aria-hidden="true">🗺️</div>
        <h3>Receive Your Itinerary</h3>
        <p>We prepare a suitable route with accommodation, transport and sightseeing details.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="process-card">
        <span class="process-number" aria-hidden="true">04</span>
        <div class="process-icon" aria-hidden="true">🏔️</div>
        <h3>Confirm and Travel</h3>
        <p>Review the plan, confirm the package and receive support for the journey.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 text-center">
      <a href="{{ '/contact/#enquiry-form' | htmlBaseUrl }}" class="btn-primary">Start Planning My Trip</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
